Third-party components
----------------------

Released binaries will embed ffmpeg, built with x264, as a WebAssembly module
(codeberg.org/gruf/go-ffmpreg). ffmpeg built with x264 is distributed under the GNU General Public
License, which is why qrvt as a whole is GPL-3.0-or-later. The corresponding source of that module,
its build script and its licence notices will be shipped with the first release that embeds it.

Go module dependencies keep their own licences; see go.mod for the list.
